sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Cliente
  participant K as Consumer
  participant S as GameSession
  participant G as Game (engine)
  C->>K: {type:"cmd", cmd:{type:"move",...}}
  K->>S: handle_command(user, cmd)
  S->>G: apply(cmd com player do servidor)
  G-->>S: eventos ou GameError
  S-->>C: match_state (view do jogador + eventos públicos)
  Note over S: reinicia timer se o turno mudou
